<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικατα-λαμβάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>follow and catch up,
			overtake</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ναῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.90
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					3.111
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.66.3
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελήνη ἥλιον ἐ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				39c
			</span></i>: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταξὺ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δὲ ἁμέρα-λαμβάνει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					4.952.14
				</span></i>
			 (Epid.):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				611b33
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>. of fruit
			which forms before the last year's fruit is ripe, <i>overtakes</i>
			it, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.6.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>fasten,
				bind on</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατάπλασμα ταινιδίῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					13.357
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. Gramm. in 
				Pass.
			, of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σημεῖα</span>, <i>to be
				understood after</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.166
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
